    "body": "Replaced the wide cards with portrait Steam box-art tiles. Each game now has one corner status icon; the duplicate Added/Ready text is gone. Hover or keyboard focus shows the path, scan state, problems, and action. Font controls now appear only for games that declare fonts, and their hover lists each font by name with a check or X. Artwork is cached privately and the neutral fallback works offline. Restart LEXEDITOR and inspect the main menu.",
